<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 9.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 9.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    94/95    101/102     UNQ     172/178</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   97/99    103/105   188/190   196/198</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes were steady Monday despite minor berth congestion, traders said. Some suppliers could not lift cargoes due to the congestion, slightly tightening the supply side. But suppliers did not raise offers and demand remained poor.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
